        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Nice store and the only place you can find the écolo books required by LBPSB.\n\nYou need to know your price as you can find much of the supplies cheaper at Walmart, Bureau en Gros.  That said, this is a one stop shopping.  You should be able to find all the school supplies here.\n\nLots of parking along the side and you can access the site from the backside (it is well marked).",
