        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I went here with my sister to buy her school supplies. As we were trying to return something as well - I was surprised that the worker started to be rude and arrogant when we made exchange. I was caught by surprised and I am honestly extremely disappointed how we were treated. tsk! The fact that my sister even noticed how she reacts speaks volume.",
